@host = http://localhost:5212
# Paste an access token issued by CIMS Identity (audience cims-nextmcc-api, scope cims.nextmcc, with a "tenant" claim).
# Development without Identity: a local token from `dotnet user-jwts create --scheme DevJwt ...` (see deploy/spike).
@token = <paste-access-token-here>
# Optional: only honoured if this value is listed in the token's "tenants" claim, otherwise 403.
@tenant = NextMCC

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/health

### Field captions (replaces legacy DataApi/getfldParas)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reference/field-captions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant: {{tenant}}
Accept: application/json

### Legacy cookie bridge: 204 + Set-Cookie .AspNet.ApplicationCookie (docs/09 section 4.3)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/legacy-session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Legacy cookie bridge: Development only, decodes the incoming legacy cookie
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legacy-session/inspect

### Legacy cookie bridge: sign out (expired Set-Cookie)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/legacy-session
